---
import AplusPage from '../layouts/AplusPage.astro';
---
<AplusPage
  title="Healthcare Engineers | A+ Active Services"
  eyebrow="Designed by Healthcare Engineers"
  heading="Healthcare Engineer is the pattern interrupt."
  intro="A+ Active Services is built around healthcare engineers: operators who can translate clinical documentation, staffing pressure, EHR-adjacent workflows, and AI tool friction into a safer first workflow."
>
  <section class="aplus-screen-stack" aria-label="Healthcare engineer positioning">
    <article>
      <p class="aplus-kicker">Design partner</p>
      <h2>We are not selling more tools. We are selling judgment under constraints.</h2>
      <p>The retainer exists for teams who need a healthcare engineer to translate messy operations into a demo, a safety boundary, and a next action that someone can actually buy.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="aplus-kicker">ROI driver</p>
      <h2>The business case is time, cost, risk, and momentum.</h2>
      <p>We quantify wasted admin hours, delayed follow-up, wrong-fit builds, stalled launches, and the cost of waiting another quarter to learn from real users.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
  <section class="aplus-content-grid">
    <article>
      <h2>Product judgment</h2>
      <p>We start with the smallest useful workflow: what AI can draft, summarize, classify, or check while a human stays responsible for approval.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h2>Operational context</h2>
      <p>Healthcare AI succeeds or fails in the handoff, inbox, spreadsheet, note, EHR boundary, phone queue, and back office. Those details shape the build.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h2>Ecosystem leverage</h2>
      <p>The collective gives physicians, clinics, founders, podcast guests, and partners a shared place to learn, prototype, sell, and find the next collaborator.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</AplusPage>
